-依赖关系图：
-
-```
-                core-contacts
-                     │
-   ┌──────────┬──────┼──────┬─────────┬─────────┬──────┐
-   ▼          ▼      ▼      ▼         ▼         ▼      ▼
-core-      core-   core-  core-     core-     core-  core-
-storage    context http   push      protocol  types  im
-(读写DB)   (身份)  (HTTP) (Notif    (帧编码)  (错误码) (trait
-                         trigger)                     only,
