-**用例 B：服务端推送 trigger（张三改头像）**
-
-```
-push 通道收到 Notification.type = "UserProfileChange", target = "zhangsan_uid"
-   │
-   ▼
-core-push → notif_subscribe → core-contacts.supervisor
-   │
-   ▼
-supervisor 调 http.describe_users(["zhangsan_uid"])
-   │
