-## 11. 事件 surface
-
-`ContactMutation` 是 `#[non_exhaustive]` enum，6 个 variant：
-
-| variant | 字段 |
-|---|---|
-| `UserUpdated` | `ws`, `ids: Vec<UserId>` |
-| `UserTombstoned` | `ws`, `ids: Vec<UserId>` |
-| `GroupUpdated` | `ws`, `ids: Vec<GroupId>` |
-| `GroupMembersChanged` | `ws`, `group_id`, `added: Vec<UserId>`, `removed: Vec<UserId>` |
-| `RelationChanged` | `ws`, `target: UserId`, `state: RelationState` |
-| `SyncPhaseChanged` | `ws`, `phase: SyncPhase`, `reason: MxReasonCode` |
-
-`SyncPhase` 状态：`Idle` / `FullPulling { progress_percent: u8 }` / `IncrementalApplying` / `UplinkFlushing`。
-
-通道：`broadcast::channel(capacity = 256)`。慢订阅者被覆盖丢帧不阻塞 sender；下次网络回归触发的全量对账自然修正状态。`ContactMutation` 与 `ConversationMutation` 的级联关系按 [`change-notification.md §4.4`](../02-phase-2-database/change-notification.md#44-contacts--groups-级联-emit-conversations-缓存事件) 已定义路径执行。
