-```
-MX_ERR_NULL_POINTER(-1)
-MX_ERR_BUFFER_TOO_SMALL(-2)
-MX_ERR_INVALID_INPUT(-3)
-MX_ERR_TRANSPORT_CLOSED(100)
-MX_ERR_NOT_SUPPORTED(102)
-MX_ERR_CLOCK_REJECTED(200)
-MX_ERR_NOT_LOGGED_IN(201)
-```
-
-Codes match `mxcore.h` constants exactly.
-
-### 5.2 IKey
